WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.460
Speaker 1: Sean HANNITY on his radio show&nbsp;
was confronted by a caller saying, Dude,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:12.240
you lied on air. You knew Trump didn't really&nbsp;
win in 2020. We know from the text messages that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:18.480
were revealed and we know from Rupert Murdoch's&nbsp;
deposition under oath, we know you were lying when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:22.800
you went on air and said, oh, there was fraud and&nbsp;
Trump really won and all of this different stuff.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:32.460
And HANNITY tries to backpedal and explain away.&nbsp;
And it is a delight to see. This is from the Ari&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:38.400
MELBER MSNBC show where they compiled a bunch&nbsp;
of different things. The back story, of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:45.360
is that on air on Fox after the 2020 election,&nbsp;
HANNITY And Laura Ingraham and Tucker and many&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:51.720
others were pretending. We now know that they&nbsp;
agreed, yeah, Trump really won. It was stolen. Joe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:56.100
Biden didn't really win. And privately, they were&nbsp;
texting each other saying, these people are crazy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.100 --> 00:01:00.960
This doesn't make any sense. Take a look at this.
Speaker 5: You knew the election wasn't stolen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.840
from Trump and you guys lied&nbsp;
about it anyway because you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:06.660
felt you had a good reason.
Speaker 1: So this is a caller&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:11.160
to Hannity's show a few days ago.
Speaker 6: No, if you listen to what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:15.840
I said on the air every day, what did&nbsp;
I talk about? Well, let me remind you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:20.580
many Americans do not believe that this&nbsp;
election was fair. I feel that way. Why do you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:25.920
say corrupt and an embarrassing disgrace while.
Speaker 5: Asking you if you all knew that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:30.660
election wasn't stolen from Trump and yet you.
Speaker 6: No, no, no. You're not listening to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:36.600
what I'm saying. I said I had problems,&nbsp;
that there were integrity issues. Our&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:42.420
Dominion system is prone to human error.&nbsp;
72 million Americans voted for Donald&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:51.900
Trump. All of them, all of us deserve an answer.
Speaker 1: Right? So this is just a sampling of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.900 --> 00:02:00.360
the placating that HANNITY did. So, listen, it's&nbsp;
at this point, there really isn't a question. We&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:06.420
know that people like HANNITY and Ingram and&nbsp;
Tucker Carlson are entertainers and they are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:12.960
