was blowing, they couldn't come out and say, guys,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:19.860
Trump lost. That's it. That's what they knew.&nbsp;
That's what they believed. That's what they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:26.580
said privately. Trump lost. Joe Biden won. But&nbsp;
they're not in a position to actually say that to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:32.460
