00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:44.940
entertainers while privately there had they had&nbsp;
their views about the facts of the matter. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:51.600
proves to us they aren't true believers&nbsp;
when it comes to someone like Sidney Powell,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:56.100
that kooky lawyer who has been disbarred&nbsp;
now from multiple bar associations.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:04.200
She does seem like a true believer. She actually&nbsp;
seems insane. She raises religious aspects to what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:08.940
she did and believes. And all these are she seems&nbsp;
genuinely out of her mind like a true believer.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:16.260
But HANNITY, Tucker Ingram and others, they didn't&nbsp;
believe it. We suspected they didn't believe it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:21.600
They wanted to maintain their audience. Says they&nbsp;
wanted to maintain their jobs and their incomes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:27.240
and probably in many of these cases, they wanted&nbsp;
to maintain friendliness with Donald Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:32.640
