FOX News depending on what happens. And that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.160 --> 00:04:00.180
would be great. And it's not about me. You know,&nbsp;
I know that they're I'm already getting messages&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:04.500
from right wingers saying, David, you're just&nbsp;
advocating for censorship. When you say, I hope&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:10.140
this lawsuit is terrible for Fox News. You're&nbsp;
advocating for them to be censored. No, no, no.&nbsp;&nbsp;

